  "description": "Complete N-Tier architecture generator for .NET 8. Generates Core, DAL, Business, API, and Shared layers with Repository Pattern, AutoMapper, FluentValidation, and sample CRUD operations. Use 'dotnet netschema generate' to create full project structure.",
