  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.0.3 - Documentation Update: Enhanced README with complete usage guide, step-by-step quick start instructions, architecture diagrams and examples, troubleshooting section added, better customization examples, complete API endpoint documentation, migration and configuration guides. Features: One command to generate 5-layer architecture, Repository Pattern with soft delete, AutoMapper and FluentValidation integration, Sample CRUD controller with Swagger, Dependency Injection pre-configured. Quick Start: 1. dotnet tool install --global NetSchema 2. mkdir MyApp and cd MyApp 3. dotnet new sln -n MyApp 4. dotnet netschema generate. GitHub: https://github.com/emilhuseyn/NetSchema",
